{"id":"n72882-1-5","stage":2,"title":"인력 · 人力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72882-1-5-1","ko":"옆집 남자가 교통사고로 다 죽게 생겼대요.","zh":"听说隔壁那位男士出了车祸，快没命了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆집","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남자가","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교통사고로","meaning":"交通事故","explanation":"교통사고：交通事故；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"교통사고","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35968","senseId":"1","lemma":"교통사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죽게","meaning":"死","explanation":"죽다：死；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20851","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼대요.","meaning":"表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。","explanation":"생기다：表示造成前面所表达的不好的状况。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67899","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definiti