58","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"3255b0b5500a0f94","term":"목숨","zh":"命，生命，性命","audio":"/audio/3255b0b5500a0f947550.mp3","entryId":"16152","definition":"人或动物呼吸着生存的力量。","pronunciation":["목쑴"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"怎么，哪里，哪能","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60320","definition":"用于反问的语气，意在强调。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"4d7d303784366200","term":"인력","zh":"人力","audio":"/audio/4d7d3037843662002558.mp3","entryId":"72882","definition":"人的力量或能力。","pronunciation":["일력"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83215bc4eae579173e9c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.175,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72882","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":2.0017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["人的生死哪能由人力控制呢？","报告已经写完了吗？","听说隔壁那位男士出了车祸，快没命了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["人的生死哪能由人力控制呢？","听说隔壁那位男士出了车祸，快没命了。","报告已经写完了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
